xceed 100% of shares (a sign of heavy share lending).","Insider trading is two-way: 6 purchases and 11 sales over the past year, net $4.9M sold.","It returns 16.4% a year to shareholders (11.6% in buybacks and 4.4% in dividends).","The share count has shrunk 2.3% a year over five years, steadily raising each holder's stake.","It pays out 750% of earnings, more than it earns, so the dividend is at risk.","Short interest is elevated at 10.9% of the float, 6.1 days to cover."],"people":["With about 3,683 employees, each generates about $344K of revenue, 0.7x the Consumer Defensive median, and revenue has grown 4.7% a year across its filed history.","That works out to $42K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $2.4M (7x revenue per employee).","Stock compensation averages $6K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"WATCH","conv":70,"head":"Watch: composite 52, above the 39 line, but it earns less than its cost of capital.","pros":["Composite 52, above the 39 line (gates 16/26)","Trades 18% below fair value of $66.70","FCF margin 12.1%","Net cash of $45.1M","EV/EBITDA 4.7x vs sector 10.2x"],"cons":["ROIC 4.4% vs WACC 9.2%","P/E 171.0x vs sector 18.3x","Operating margin contracting 1.3%/yr"],"flags":[],"need":["it earns less than its cost of capital"],"buy_below":56.69,"vc":{"base":66.7,"base_src":"dcf","bear":56.57,"bull":80.33,"alt_median":41.87,"n_alt":3,"gap":0.5929,"dispersion":0.2207,"level":"LOW","why":["DCF is 59% above the other models' median ($41.87)"]},"med":{"pe":18.2995,"ev_ebitda":10.1945,"pfcf":16.1417,"pb":2.1175,"roic":0.1185,"gross_margin":0.3401,"fcf_margin":0.0601,"div_yield":0.0291}},"mc_quantiles":[49.75,54.05,56.57,58.24,59.78,61.18,62.19,63.49,64.6,65.74,66.9,68.16,69.31,70.43,71.99,73.56,75.36,77.27,80.33,84.36,93.62],"mc_drivers":{"growth":0.556,"discount_rate":0.342,"terminal_growth":0.023,"exit_multiple":0.079},"ticker":"STRA","date":"2026-11-13"}